    "created_at": "2026-03-09T13:44:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-09T13:44:31Z",
    "body": "Why is `hashchange` dispatch from a task there? Is the idea that \"restore persisted state\" can run in parallel, but this isn't stated?\n\n(None of which explains a FIXME in WebKit I ran across today `// FIXME: popstate event and hashchange event are supposed to fire in a single task.` that makes this a bit more mysterious. To me anyway.)",
